        { "visual": "Para comparar con adjetivos cortos, agregamos '-er' + 'than' (que). Fast -> Faster than (Más rápido que).", "audio": "To compare with short adjectives, add -er plus than. Fast becomes faster than." },
        { "visual": "Si termina en 'e', solo agrega 'r': Nice -> Nicer. Si termina en 'y', cambia a 'i': Easy -> Easier. Excepción: Good -> Better.", "audio": "If it ends in e, just add r. Nice becomes nicer. If it ends in y, change to i. Easy becomes easier. Exception: Good becomes better." }
      ]
